Cell["\<\
Because our deflection solution is analytical, Manipulate is nice and fast:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9926485266604214`*^9, 
  3.9926485597256527`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bdbab2ab-d079-4e45-908d-\
